      "writtenOn": "2021-01-13T00:03:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "SignalThresholdInfo allows empty thresholds to disable reporting for system caller. While we don\u0027t allow empty thresholds for apps, validating here just make the logic a bit easier.",
